            <ArticleTitle>Operative technique for thoracoscopic transmyocardial laser revascularization.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>351-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe herein the operative steps used to perform a transmyocardial laser revascularization by thoracoscopy. A special technique and specific equipment are required for the efficacy and safety of the procedure. Our preliminary results with this novel approach suggest that it could be a valid alternative to the thoracotomic procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
